夫君似乎挺好玩的。想到这，苏小凡眉眼弯弯的说：“好，我答应。”她忽然很期待这小宝贝儿长大后会是如何的倾城绝色。“凡儿……”贾氏闻言抓住了苏小凡的手，神情颇为激动。“娘，没事儿的，你看我这被张家退亲，想必日后也不好嫁出去，而且你看那小宝贝儿长的多水灵呀。”苏小凡浅浅的笑着，脸颊上两个小酒窝煞是可爱。贾氏转头看了一眼，又继续说：“村长家的孙子是生的很好，可是你们年龄相差也太多了呀，难保日后他不会好好待你。”苏小凡冲那个粉雕玉琢的小娃娃扬了扬眉说：“娘，这你就不懂了，这俗话说，女大一抱金鸡，女大二金满罐，女大三抱金砖，女大四福寿至，女大五赛老母，女大六乐个够，女大七笑嘻嘻，女大八准发家，女大九样样有，女大十样样值，我这是比他大几岁？”萧长富闻言眉开眼笑的接话：“是啊，大妹子，照凡丫头说的，她要是跟我家小孙子成亲了，这往后的小日子可是样样有啊，小日子肯定是过的风生水起的，你们就放心吧。”“哦，小宝贝儿六岁了吗？”苏小凡走了过去，伸手就在那粉嫩嫩的小脸蛋儿上摸了一把，然后回味无穷的说：“手感真不错，宝贝儿，来姐姐抱抱。”说完就蹲下身子对着那小瓷娃娃张开了双臂，准备揽其入怀好好疼爱一番。谁料小人儿竟灵活的躲开了她，站到村长的另一边去了，一脸嫌弃的看着她，腔正字圆的说：“别叫我小宝贝儿，我叫萧遗墨，遗产的遗，墨水的墨。”“哦，挺好的名字。”苏小凡努努嘴，没想到自己竟然被一个小娃娃给嫌弃了，想从前，自己可是狠招小孩子喜欢的，这凡是小孩子都喜欢粘着自己的呀。“那么就这么说定了哦，明日我便将钱送过来，凡丫头明日起就到我家去住吧。”萧长富说完便准备牵上萧遗墨向她们告辞。“等等，我还有个条件。”苏小凡听他如此说，看了贾氏跟叶氏一眼后觉得不妥，虽然那村长家似乎要比这里条件好，但是若自己走了，这即将临盆的妇人跟年事已高的老人要如何过日子啊。萧长富意味深长的看了她一眼后，问：“说来听听。”苏小凡勾唇一笑，缓缓道：“您看，我奶奶年事已高，娘亲也即将临盆，我想在家里住到娘亲生完，然后能照顾奶奶跟弟弟妹妹时再去你家。”萧长富用眼神询问了下身旁的小小人后，说：“难得凡丫头如此有孝心，好，我同意，不过，这期间，小孙儿与你一同住在这里。”“村长，这不太好吧，你看我们家这……”叶氏意有所指的看向了空无一物的堂屋，村长家虽然也是住在这穷沟僻壤的乡下，却是远近驰名的有钱人，家里盖的院子比城里的那些大官人家的都还要好，村长的孩子在外经商，据说每年都会托人捎回来不少的银子，想必这小孙子是从小没吃过什么苦的娃子，如何能过如此艰苦的日子。“没关系，正好让这孩子历练历练。”萧长富眸中的笑意加深，捋着胡须看向一旁黑了一张脸的萧遗墨。“娘，既然村长都这样说了，就照村长说的办吧，我也舍不得凡儿这么快就去了别人家。”贾氏开心的附和道，既能度过眼下的难关，又能再留凡儿在自己身边一段日子，算是天大的好事呀，而且凡儿似乎对去村长家当童养媳没有什么不满的。其实说起来，原本就是自己家的凡儿高攀了，想当年村长家的儿子还在村里的时候，想嫁进村长家的人那是数不胜数啊，只是这两人的年龄相差实在太大了，不过村长既然说了这日后他那小孙子不会纳妾，应该是没有什么好担忧的了。“好，老身谢过村长了。”叶氏感激涕零的对着萧长富福了福身子，虽然苦了凡儿，但是眼下的确是解决了家里的生计。“您言重了，那么我就先回去了，墨就住这吧。”萧长富凝望了萧遗墨几眼后，才抬脚离开。“村长慢走。”叶氏也跟随而去，送他离去。“小宝贝儿，过来，让姐姐抱抱。”苏小凡再次凑到了萧遗墨的身边，想要抱一抱他。萧遗墨冷冷的扫了她一眼，抬起小腿儿离她远了几步，淡淡的说：“不要叫我小宝贝儿，还有，你不是我姐姐，是我媳妇儿。”苏小凡无可奈何的摇了摇头，难道这个时代的小孩子都是这般早熟的吗？不理会他的疏离，笑着问：“小宝贝儿知道媳妇儿是什么吗？”－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－求收，求评，", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 4 Young husband: \"You misunderstood. It's not as serious as selling someone.\" Xiao Changfu thought for a moment and then continued: \"The main reason is that I fell in love with the character of the girl in your family. Although my grandson is young, he will definitely marry the girl as soon as he grows up. From now on, the family will never have concubines or anything like that.\" She stared at Xiao Changfu for a moment, and saw that he didn't seem to be lying. She looked at Jia with some embarrassment. At present, there was indeed no rice to cook at home. Some of the food she bought before had also been taken away by those heartless things. Fan'er's health was not good yet. After Zhiyan gave birth, she would need some food during confinement. Jia's face was as embarrassed as hers. Although the family situation was not optimistic, she did not want to miss Fan'er's youth because of this. When his grandson grew up, Fan'er would have passed the age of blooming flowers. By then, would the little grandson still treat Fan'er well? Compared with the two of them, the person involved, Su Xiaofan, was extremely calm. He carefully looked at the pink and jade-carved little doll held by the village chief. It had long curly eyelashes, big black eyes, a delicate little nose, and small and red lips. This little baby was more dewy than ordinary little girls. It's just that the twinkling light in the black eyes seems to be quite mature, not as innocent as a child of his age. Having been divorced, it must be difficult for her to get married in this era, and ten years later, she will only be in her twenties. In the end, it is the little milk baby in front of her who will suffer. Ah, do you want old cows to eat young grass in the future? It seems to be quite fun to raise a little husband from an early age. Thinking of this, Su Xiaofan said with curved eyebrows: \"Okay, I agree.\" She suddenly looked forward to how stunning this little baby would be when she grew up. \"Fan'er...\" When Jia heard this, she grabbed Su Xiaofan's hand and looked quite excited. \"Mom, it's okay. You see, I have been disowned by the Zhang family, so it will be difficult for me to get married in the future. And look at how beautiful that little baby is.\" Su Xiaofan smiled lightly, and the two small dimples on his cheeks were really cute. Jia turned around and took a look, then continued: \"The grandson of the village chief's family is very good, but the age difference between you is too big. There is no guarantee that he will not treat you well in the future.\" Su Xiaofan raised his eyebrows at the pink and jade-carved little doll and said: \"Mom, you don't understand this, this vulgarity By the way, a freshman girl holds a golden rooster, a sophomore girl holds a pot full of gold, a senior girl holds gold bricks, a senior girl has good luck and longevity, a senior girl has a lot of fun, a senior girl is smiling, a senior girl is sure to make a fortune, a senior girl has nine things, and a senior girl is worth ten things. How much older am I than him? \"Xiao Changfu heard? Yan Yan answered with a smile: \"Yes, eldest sister, according to what girl Fan said, if she gets married to my little grandson, she will have all kinds of things in her little life in the future. Her little life will definitely be prosperous, so don't worry.\" \"Oh, is the little darling six years old?\" Su Xiaofan walked over, stretched out his hand and touched the tender little face, and then said with endless aftertaste: \"It feels really good, baby, come and give me a hug.\" After saying that, he knelt down and opened his arms to the little porcelain doll, ready to take it into his arms and love it. Unexpectedly, the little man avoided her nimbly and stood on the other side of the village chief. He looked at her with a look of disgust and said in a straight tone: \"Don't call me little baby, my name is Xiao Yimo, the legacy of the inheritance, the ink of the ink.\" \"Oh, it's a good name.\" Su Xiaofan pursed her lips, but she didn't expect that she would be disliked by a little baby. She thought that in the past, she was very popular with children, and all children like to stick to her. \"Then it's settled, I will send the money over tomorrow, and all the girls can come to live in my house from tomorrow on.\" After Xiao Changfu said this, he was ready to take Xiao Yimo and say goodbye to them. \"Wait a minute, I still have a condition.\" Su Xiaofan heard what he said, and after taking a look at Jia and Ye, he felt something was wrong. Although the village chief's house seemed to have better conditions than here, if he left, how would the woman who was about to give birth and the old man live? Xiao Changfu glanced at her meaningfully and asked, \"Tell me.\" Su Xiaofan curled his lips and smiled, and said slowly: \"Look, my grandma is old and my mother is about to give birth. I want to live at home until my mother gives birth, and then I can take care of her.\" I'll go to your house when Grandma Gu is with her brothers and sisters.\" Xiao Changfu looked at the little person next to him and said, \"It's rare for a girl to be so filial, okay, I agree, but in the meantime, my grandson will live here with you.\" \"Village Chief, this is not good. Look at our house...\" Mrs. Ye pointedly looked at the empty main house. Although the village chief's family also lived in this poor and remote countryside, they were well-known rich people. The yard built at home was larger than The families of the high-ranking officials in the city are all better off. The village chief's child is doing business abroad, and it is said that he asks someone to bring back a lot of money every year. It must be that this little grandson has never suffered much since he was a child, how can he live such a difficult life. \"It doesn't matter, it's just for this kid to practice.\" The smile in Xiao Changfu's eyes deepened, he stroked his beard and looked at Xiao Yimo, whose face was darkened. \"Mom, since the village chief has said so, let's do as the village chief said. I can't bear to let Fan'er go to someone else's house so soon.\" Jia agreed happily. It was a great blessing to be able to get through the current difficulties and keep Fan'er by her side for a while, and Fan'er didn't seem to have any dissatisfaction with going to the village chief's house to be a child bride. In fact, speaking of it, Fan'er, who was originally from his own family, has become a high-ranking man. I think back when the village chief's son was still in the village, there were countless people who wanted to marry into the village chief's family. However, the age difference between the two was too big. However, since the village chief said that his grandson would not take concubines in the future, there should be nothing to worry about. \"good,", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}